Predict the output of the following Python code:<pre>data = [3, 8, 5, 12, 7, 9]
res = []
for i in range(len(data)):
    if data[i] % 2 == 0:
        res.append(data[i] // 2)
    elif i % 2 == 0:
        res.append(data[i] * 10)
    else:
        res.insert(0, data[i])
print(res)</pre>

